{"reviewId": "3126459_7ZFaJ1LBB", "review": {"abstract": "当这种失衡导致世界主导国（美国）和主导货币（美元）因赤字和债务而发生信用危机时，世界的失衡必须得到调整，否则我们可能会面临更大的全球性危机。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "当下中美是不是到了这个地步？美国巨额债务到了积重难返的时候了吗？畸高的黄金价格、反常的美债利率等现象似乎预示着美元信用体系的弱化。\n\n经查腾讯元宝，2024年联邦债务占GDP超过100%，已接近历史高位（二战后106%），超过《马斯特里赫特条约》设定的60%警戒线，也高于世界银行提出的77%经济增长风险阈值，利息支出达1.13万亿美元。美国债务率已处于历史高位，且长期不可持续性凸显。尽管短期违约风险较低（依赖再融资和国内市场消化能力 ），但债务规模扩张速度、利息负担及政策不确定性（如债务上限谈判僵局 ）已对全球经济稳定构成系统性威胁。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "13304-13374", "createTime": 1745537867, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "3126459_7ZFaJ1LBB", "userVid": 3126459, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 3126459, "name": "firstprinciple", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/XYrRG5UShDd1OS4NmWmYVvGiahSoB8vicj5rBuDzEmgHdlDvOsl7jtCScOZuryFyyUSvvBSiaqaEak/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "firstprinciple", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 9, "likes": [{"userVid": 414458585, "name": "🌲", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-qHEk9NbwnipEQVkzI37JJ10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "